[b]Patch 0.1.1[/b] - Small changes and fixes based on your feedback!

[b]List of Patch changes:[/b]
- Fixed Shadows on character and weapons;
- Changed the default graphics API to DirectX 11 for better support;
- Optimized demo level shadows;
- Added full ability to customize quality, including disabling Shadows in the game's Graphics Settings;
- Fixed the size of the Pause menu bar;
- Accelerated the appearance of the inscription at the death of the character;
- Disabled the effect of particles of the appearance of weapons to finalize;
- Reduced the volume of the Healing effect when Health PowerUp is selected;
- Fixed the Skill Charge bug when using the Q skill on Crystals;
- Ogres are now immune to the Attraction control effect;
- Rebalanced creep damage, character survivability, and Q skill damage;
- Improved some character animations,
- Fixed character controller bugs preventing the character from moving after an attack or a series of attacks.

You can report all the bugs you find in the official community of the game developers, as well as there to share your suggestions and feedback.

[b]We remind you that access to the demo will end with the end of the Festival “Games to be October 2024”![/b]
